i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BmDbD2HDOVkQ7kNvwEkXbCc&_nc_oc=AdphFouuwqJzWqrRner59CJOtsnYS2Q_G60ePra453ADW2UUA4OvWsUaxJmrug7WGUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBR0nqxSjKeq0nOvA7sQsZefrTgevEChF0t9NW6oCUeg&oe=6AF74463"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YSseRdWYXxQQ7kNvwH5Q6qO&_nc_oc=AdrgklMUPQBwxuRtfJ6qwSizCvD6CikKmnY030zXktWnSI0DAp1cuKMLHhEXjLxicXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRNX7Ls8-b31rVUFAMQEoPNTIcQOEBhT8C49r0rFs-vg&oe=6AF7305D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pgErlLA1XBUQ7kNvwGfzsRd&_nc_oc=AdqEaerxVqTehxH6O1AkD-gA60lnAHpX2swkpucAXH6iW1hiZNqzjjQOTDMEoViLyDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd-jcZS1cKkQrRPSFuNMUg7SXfmj8jVBSX1kc3QrONNA&oe=6AF71ECA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im